- Synthesize an accurate, minimal set of facts in `new_notes` sufficient to verify the claim.
- Select all relevant context article titles that precisely cover the entities and facts in `new_notes` to create the `titles` list.
- Deliver outputs clearly and separated as `new_notes` (list of fact statements) and `titles` (list of titles).
